{% comment %}
  Customisation (jewellery making) charges, from the owner's
  "Customisation Pricing Sheet" (Oct 2026).

  Shape:  window.PC_CUSTOM_PRICING[type][group][designNo] = [Panchdhatu, Copper, Silver (925)]
    type   : ring | pendant | bracelet
    group  : female | male  (pendant designs are not gendered → "all")
    amounts: whole rupees. The product page multiplies by 100 (paise).

  "_default" is the charge for a design that is NOT listed here (a newly
  uploaded design the sheet does not price yet, or the no-preset-designs
  case). It is set to the most common price in that group.

  Gold / White Gold / Platinum stay on the flat Rs. 35,000 advance set on
  the metal radios in sections/main-product.liquid — they are not priced
  by design.

  To update prices: edit the numbers below, keep the [P, C, S] order.
  Design numbers are the ones shown on the design cards ("Design 7") and
  encoded in the CDN file names (…_PDFL07_…, …_PN07.webp, …_CO07.webp).
{% endcomment %}
